window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The Blood Curse—hunger, madness, Final Death.</b><br> <br> As countless vampires perish in torment, the survivors jockey ruthlessly for any advantage. Owain Evans, Ventrue elder and Sabbat spy, is drawn more deeply into deadly plots as figures from his past emerge to call due forgotten promises from centuries gone by. And that may be the least of his worries....<br> <br> Disturbing visions haunt Owain night and day. Is he touched by the Curse, or something far more sinister?<br> <br> This second volume of the Trilogy of the Blood Curse follows <i>The Devil's Advocate</i> and interweaves characters and action with the Vampire: The Dark Ages saga Grails Covenant Trilogy.</p>"; 
